  "description": "The Horizon SUV 10 Wave combines full e-trekking capability with an easy-access low step-through frame. Its bright LED lighting increases visibility, while the Racktime carrier with KID'n'CARRY and SNAPIT 2.0 compatibility supports daily trips, errands and family transport. A trailer can be attached when extra capacity is needed.\n\nComfort and control are enhanced by an adjustable stem, SP Connect for mounting your smartphone, and a dropper seat post that simplifies mounting, dismounting and stop‑and‑go riding. Comfortable wide trekking tires and full fenders keep the ride smooth and clean, and 120mm of front suspension absorbs bumps on paved and gravel segments. The reliable 11-speed drivetrain supports both daily riding and longer weekend outings.\n\nThe Bosch Performance Line CX motor and removable 800Wh PowerTube battery deliver strong, lasting support. Compatible with the PowerMore range extender and fully integrated with the Bosch Smart System and eBike Flow App, it offers a connected and flexible riding experience.",
